'''''Rhodobryum''''' is a genus of [[moss]]es belonging to the family [[Bryaceae]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Rhodobryum (Schimp.) Limpr. |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/5281372 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=24 February 2021 |language=en}}</ref>

The genus has [[cosmopolitan distribution]].<ref name="GBIF" />

